00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.040
- I adore you so much

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:15.360
and I celebrate your
existence here on earth.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:19.530
- My 40s were my absolute favorite.

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:23.820
