in your life and enjoy it.

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.290
- I wish you so much love and light.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:26.123
- Happy birthday.

00:00:26.123 --> 00:00:29.100
I am so ecstatic and I congratulate you,

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:33.480
and I respect you deeply
and admire you so much

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.313
and adore you.

00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:36.942
