00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:39.240
- KC. It's KC.

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:43.860
You're gonna be 41, and I
wish I could remember 41.

00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.380
My only advice to you is
just remember everyday.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:48.510
- I hope you have a fantastic day.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:49.343
- We love it.

00:00:49.343 --> 00:00:50.280
You're an April baby like me.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:51.113
You're a cusp.

00:00:51.113 --> 00:00:51.946
- We're Aries.
- We're Aries cusp.

00:00:51.946 --> 00:00:52.779
- You're Taurus,

00:00:52.779 --> 00:00:53.612
but we feel connected.
- You're bringing the energy

00:00:53.612 --> 00:00:54.750
and we feel connected.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.670
- Just have an awesome, awesome birthday

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:58.350
and will be thinking about you.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:00:59.940
- Happy birthday, Spring Girl.

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:01.380
I hope the sun comes out for you.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:02.550
I'm sure it will.

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:04.560
Have a beautiful, happy birthday.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.470
- Kelly Clarkson. Happy birthday.

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:09.960
You deserve to celebrate all the things

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:12.282
that you give to others, you sun shiny,

00:01:12.282 --> 00:01:14.280
beautiful (beep) soul.

00:01:14.280 --> 00:01:15.450
I love you.

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:17.460
- Happy birthday, beautiful.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:19.470
I know I'm your second favorite person

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:20.430
