00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:23.880
Trisha Yearwood loves you.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:26.490
She says, have the happiest of birthdays.

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:30.630
- Miss Clarkson, the
happiest of birthdays to you.

00:01:30.630 --> 00:01:32.460
- Kelly, happy birthday.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:34.005
- Happy birthday, Kelly.

00:01:34.005 --> 00:01:36.120
- Happy birthday from the past.

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.170
- Just know that this year,

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:39.090
from April of this year
to April of next year,

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:40.140
it's all about value.

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:41.790
Where you find value
personally, emotionally,

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:44.130
mentally, spiritually, and professionally.

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:45.263
- [Trio] Happy birthday, Kelly.

00:01:46.318 --> 00:01:47.850
- We love you
- We love you.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:49.770
- Kelly, we've known each
other for so many years.

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:52.620
I feel like our relationship
is so deep and I just,

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.510
