of your birthdays together.

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.280
So here, let's just add another one.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.113
- You're amazing.

00:01:57.113 --> 00:01:58.320
So, thank you for the gift

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.630
