00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:01.463
Mwah!

00:02:01.463 --> 00:02:05.010
- (blows kiss) May you
have many, many, many more.

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:07.890
- Happy birthday, dear Kelly.

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:10.678
Happy birthday to you.

00:02:10.678 --> 00:02:11.579
